Package: secubox-meshname
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Meshname — Yggdrasil-overlay DNS resolver
 Meshname DNS resolver: maps RFC-compliant `.ygg` domains to
 Yggdrasil IPv6 addresses for mesh-internal name resolution.
 Provides node and mapping CRUD via the web dashboard.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the mesh cluster:
  - secubox-mesh — Yggdrasil mesh daemon control (peers, sessions,
    services). Different layer: meshname is the DNS overlay on top
    of mesh's daemon control.
  - secubox-p2p — P2P hub + master-link enrollment (canonical
    after #384).
  - secubox-daemon — Go-built mesh daemon (different runtime).
